        "CBC padding oracle",
        "When"
      ],
      "content": "CBC + PKCS#7，且服务端对 padding 是否合法给出可区分信号（错误/状态/时间）。",
      "line_start": 13,
      "line_end": 13,
      "truncated": false
    },
